  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Keralove</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding-left: 2rem; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"a-vertical a-spacing-none\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Instant straightening Keratin Treatment.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Removes frizz and curls.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Adds shine, silkiness, and softness to your hair.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Hair can be washed the same day after the application.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Will work better on chemically treated hair, like colored or relaxed. On virgin hair, the best result will be achieved after the second application.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" class=\"a-list-item\">Effects of Keralove treatment will last 3-4 months depending on the care you give to your hair.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): </span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Payment terms: </span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Other information:</span></p>\r\n</div>",
